sequenceDiagram
  actor V as Verifier (e.g. NCCIA)
  participant API as FastAPI Backend
  participant IPFS as IPFS (private node)
  participant CC as Case Crypto
  participant DB as Postgres (metadata)
  participant L as Ledger Service
  participant ETH as EvidenceRegistry (local)

  V->>API: request item + proof (shared by victim)
  API->>DB: load cid, sha256, custody events, latest anchor
  API->>IPFS: cat(cid)
  IPFS-->>API: ciphertext (CID re-derived from bytes)
  API->>CC: decrypt with case DEK
  CC-->>API: plaintext (GCM tag checked)
  API->>API: sha256(plaintext) == recorded sha256 ?
  API->>L: recompute custody chain + leaf + Merkle proof
  L-->>API: caseRoot_k, proof path
  API->>ETH: verify(caseCommitment, caseRoot_k)
  ETH-->>API: (true, index k, anchoredAt)
  API-->>V: item + leaf + proof + caseRoot_k + txHash
  V->>ETH: independent verify(caseCommitment, caseRoot_k)
